#: level_i18n.cc:56
msgid ""
"Welcome to Mexico! Eight hours ago, your plane arrived at the Airport of "
"\"Coatlicue\", which is a small village surrounded by unexplored jungle "
"terrain. Now you find yourself in front of an impressive temple, which seems"
" to be a relic of the ancient Aztec empire. But the temple is in "
"surprisingly good condition ..."
msgstr ""
"Benvido a México! Hai oito horas, o teu avión aterrou no aeroporto de "
"\"Coatlicue\", unha pequena vila rodeada de selva inexplorada. Agora "
"atópaste diante dun impresionante templo, que semella unha reliquia do "
"antigo imperio azteca. Pero o templo está en sorprendentemente bo estado ..."

#: level_i18n.cc:57
msgid ""
"Next to the giant doors of the temple you see a chrome sign: \"Restoration "
"by: G. G. Goshers, A.D. 1998\". A smaller sign beneath says: \"Property of "
"G. G. Goshers. Trespassing prohibited!\". Now you notice the dog kennels "
"built up along the front side of the temple. \"Goshers made this ancient "
"relic a fortress\", you think, \"this cannot be legal, for Goshers received "
"funding from the UK Government. I'll try to call him to account!\""
msgstr ""
"Xunto ás enormes portas do templo ves un letreiro cromado: \"Restauración "
"por: G. G. Goshers, 1998 d.C.\". Un letreiro menor debaixo di: \"Propiedade "
"de G. G. Goshers. Prohibida a entrada!\". Agora reparas nas casetas de cans "
"construídas ao longo da fachada do templo. \"Goshers converteu esta antiga "
"reliquia nunha fortaleza\", pensas, \"isto non pode ser legal, pois Goshers "
"recibiu financiamento do Goberno do Reino Unido. Intentarei pedirlle "
"contas!\""

#: level_i18n.cc:58
msgid "This guard doesn’t notice me."
msgstr "Este garda non se decata de min."

#: level_i18n.cc:59
msgid ""
"This lake was obviously made by Goshers. I think the correct way is south."
msgstr ""
"Este lago fíxoo Goshers, obviamente. Creo que o camiño correcto é ao sur."

#: level_i18n.cc:60
msgid ""
"There's an inscription on the old wall, saying in spanish: \"Careful! What "
"you touch could be the last thing you touch!\""
msgstr ""
"Hai unha inscrición na vella parede, que di en castelán: \"Coidado! O que "
"toques podería ser o último que toques!\""

#: level_i18n.cc:61
msgid "Chrome sign: \"Control of the beast’s cage.\""
msgstr "Letreiro cromado: \"Control da gaiola da besta.\""

#: level_i18n.cc:62
msgid "Oooh, this slope is steep! Try not to touch the skull!"
msgstr "Uups, esta pendente é moi pronunciada! Trata de non tocar a caveira!"

#: level_i18n.cc:63
msgid ""
"This building down there looks like a prison. Let's see if I can determine "
"its purpose ... Ah, there's another chrome sign. Goshers seems to favour "
"chrome signs. It says: \"Natives’ prison\"."
msgstr ""
"Este edificio de aí abaixo parece unha prisión. Vexamos se podo averiguar a "
"súa función ... Ah, hai outro letreiro cromado. A Goshers parece gustarlle "
"os letreiros cromados. Di: \"Prisión de nativos\"."

#: level_i18n.cc:64
msgid ""
"Getting beyond the prison building was a really good idea. But now you have "
"to cross this lake. Be thrifty with those boxes!"
msgstr ""
"Pasar por diante do edificio da prisión foi moi boa idea. Pero agora tes que"
" cruzar este lago. Sé prudente con esas caixas!"

#: level_i18n.cc:65
msgid ""
"Now, peering through the grilled prison windows, you see a native woman "
"imprisoned there. Obviously Goshers locked up all the natives, who disturbed"
" his \"work\"; trying to enter the temple and to get rich from the treasures"
" of the Aztecs. It might be helpful to be accompanied by someone, who knows "
"the secrets of the jungle and this temple ..."
msgstr ""
"Agora, mirando polas reixas da prisión, ves alí encarcerada unha muller "
"nativa. Ao parecer Goshers encerrou a todos os nativos que perturbaban o seu"
" \"traballo\"; tentando entrar no templo e enriquecerse cos tesouros dos "
"aztecas. Podería ser útil ir acompañado de alguén que coñeza os segredos da "
"selva e deste templo ..."

#: level_i18n.cc:66
msgid ""
"Since the white man there freed me from the prison, he certainly cannot be "
"as evil as this Goshers is. Perhaps he wants to end the mastery of Goshers "
"and free my people. And even if this is not the case, it's better to be free"
" than imprisoned. I think I should thank him."
msgstr ""
"Xa que o home branco alí me liberou da prisión, seguramente non pode ser tan"
" malvado coma ese Goshers. Talvez queira acabar co dominio de Goshers e "
"liberar ao meu pobo. E aínda que non fose así, mellor libre ca preso. Creo "
"que debería darlle as grazas."

#: level_i18n.cc:67
msgid ""
"You meet the English adventurer in the front of the prison. \"Hello, I'm "
"Xila!\", you tell him in broken English. After he introduced himself as "
"well, both of you begin to work out a plan against the evil G. G. Goshers."
msgstr ""
"Atopas ao aventureiro inglés diante da prisión. \"Ola, son Xila!\", dislle "
"nun inglés escaso. Despois de que el se presente, ambos comezades a idear un"
" plan contra o malvado G. G. Goshers."

#: level_i18n.cc:68
msgid ""
"This is a really hard puzzle. The English man will have to help me, if this "
"enigma is to be solved."
msgstr ""
"Este é un enigma realmente difícil. O inglés terá que axudarme se se quere "
"resolver."

#: level_i18n.cc:69
msgid "You wonder what this switch could trigger."
msgstr "Preguntáchesche que podería activar este interruptor."

#: level_i18n.cc:70
msgid "Xila knows how to drain the lake!"
msgstr "Xila sabe como drenar o lago!"

#: level_i18n.cc:71
msgid "You were lucky to find this hole. It prevents you from drowning."
msgstr "Tiveches sorte de atopar este burato. Impide que te afogues."

#: level_i18n.cc:72
msgid "This glass stone must fulfill a purpose ..."
msgstr "Esta pedra de vidro debe ter algún propósito ..."

#: level_i18n.cc:73
msgid "It's funny that such a temple should have a side entrance."
msgstr "É curioso que un templo así teña unha entrada lateral."

#: level_i18n.cc:74
msgid "Be careful! There are sensors in the walls."
msgstr "Coidado! Hai sensores nas paredes."

#: level_i18n.cc:75
msgid ""
"After the huge doors of the old temple have opened, you see, that the "
"entrance is protected by 11 knights, armed with spears. These guards are "
"very dangerous. Without a sword you'll never be able to enter. Be careful. "
"There are not only knights, but also thieves."
msgstr ""
"Despois de que se abrisen as enormes portas do vello templo, ves que a "
"entrada está protexida por 11 cabaleiros armados con lanzas. Estes gardas "
"son moi perigosos. Sen unha espada nunca poderás entrar. Ten coidado. Non só"
" hai cabaleiros, senón tamén ladróns."

#: level_i18n.cc:76
msgid "\"Congratulations. You just managed to enter this old Aztec Temple.\""
msgstr "\"Parabéns. Conseguiches entrar neste vello templo azteca.\""

#: level_i18n.cc:77
msgid ""
"\"You've been smarter than I expected. But you'll never enter the treasure "
"room nor escape from here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Fuches máis listo do que esperaba. Pero nunca entrarás na cámara do "
"tesouro nin escaparás de aquí!\""

#: level_i18n.cc:78
msgid ""
"\"I, Goshers, will certainly be able to rid myself of one of my archenemies "
"by just killing you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Eu, Goshers, seguramente poderei librarme dun dos meus arquiinimigos "
"matándote agora mesmo!\""

#: level_i18n.cc:79
msgid "\"Run for your life!\""
msgstr "\"Corre pola túa vida!\""

#: level_i18n.cc:80
msgid ""
"Xila and you just entered the Diamond Room of the old Aztec Temple. By "
"taking him back to Great Britain and rendering him to the police, you have "
"ended the evil career of Gerald Gregory Goshers. Congratulations on the "
"success of your expedition!"
msgstr ""
"Xila e ti acabades de entrar na Sala de Diamantes do vello templo azteca. Ao"
" levalo de volta a Gran Bretaña e entregalo á policía, puxeches fin á "
"malvada carreira de Gerald Gregory Goshers. Parabéns polo éxito da túa "
"expedición!"

